# Shared HP39-family Gallery suffix, relative to the USB host gate.
# Launch retries end at 61000 ms; Gallery cancels them after publishing state.
70000 capture gallery-native-mini
71000 tap enter
72000 capture gallery-native-mini-other
73000 tap down
74000 capture gallery-native-main
75000 tap enter
76000 capture gallery-native-main-other
77000 tap down
78000 capture gallery-native-editline
79000 tap enter
80000 capture gallery-native-editline-other
81000 tap right
82000 capture gallery-generated-control
83000 tap on
